{
  "name": "theta-h5-index-harvests-validation",
  "notes": "PRE-REGISTERED H5 (ADR-0265, Amendments 5-6), validation period 2021-01-04 .. 2026-01-01 (end_before; nothing on or after 2026-01-01 is read). HISTORICAL ADR RULE, verbatim (Amendment 6 below controls): **H5** index harvests on SPX/SPXW/XSP at NBBO (put-write, 1DTE strangle/condor, 16/5-delta put spread, tail-hedge cost): report Sharpe with block-bootstrap CI; pass only if the lower 90% bound > 0.5. Measurement, not proof. COMMON (ADR-0265 decisions 1-4): Split. Development 2016-01-04..2020-12-31; validation 2021-01-04..2025-12-31, run once per hypothesis, unchanged, only if the development run passed; 2024-25 is a labelled subperiod, never the sole basis of a pass; 2026 stays sealed. Universe gate: a root enters a test only from its first date with bid > 0 (the census); roots are stitched across renames. Cost model: buy at the ask, sell at the bid (NBBO); no mid fills; `close` is never a mark; our own Black-76 implied vol from the mid and the parity forward. Multiple testing: Benjamini-Hochberg 5% within a hypothesis's feature family; Bonferroni across the families for any headline claim; secondary analyses are reported, never promoted. AMENDMENT 6 controls: D3 event_gap primary; D4 labelled H2(b) primary population, measurement only, detected-only validation cannot close it; D7 SPX put-write only primary, fee/capital sensitivities descriptive; D9 only tercile-dependent readings start 2019 using 2016-2018 liquidity, original overall/half splits unchanged; D10 H7 descriptive, cannot close programme; D11 H4 monthly only, weekly-versus-monthly dropped. RUN ONCE: this is the validation run; it is not repeated, tuned or re-read. Run from children/index_options, niced, after the census, the universe freeze and the panel (ADR-0265 Amendment 5 run book): nice -n 10 python -m dskit.pipeline run configs/run-theta-h5-index-harvests-validation.json --asof 2025-12-31",
